    "message": "Map a saved Run from its floor plan and report Agents the map cannot draw\n\nThe inspector map laid every Run over the bundled gym layout, so a\ngenerated Scenario run from the CLI lost the food, intake, medical,\nquiet and staff zones and silently dropped the Agents in them, while\ngym-only zones appeared (#161).\n\nzone_map now scales model_configs.facility_geometry from the Run's\nmanifest onto the map canvas when one is recorded, including facility\npoints. Agents in a zone without a shape are returned in undrawn_agents\nand the map note names their count and zones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
